<title>ITALY: Italy records bop surplus in October.</title>
<headline>Italy records bop surplus in October.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 3.483 trillion lire surplus in October, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			     Oct 96    Sept 96    Oct 95</p>
<p> Total		     +3,483    +2,898     -1,209</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  +27,363   +24,207    +55</p>
<p> Capital movements     +928	+1,500     +318</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  -2,342    -5,019     -2,216</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
